t=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052450/extras/6ac89923ed8b630d0385cb216d1e71aa.webm?t=1739300850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052450/extras/6ac89923ed8b630d0385cb216d1e71aa.mp4?t=1739300850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Message from the Development Team</h2>Thank you for venturing into the world of &quot;Morimens&quot;! Nothing brings us greater joy than having you experience our game. If you enjoy &quot;Morimens&quot; or have any feedback about your experience, please do share it with us!<br>Though this world may be fraught with peril, we are delighted to have crossed paths.<br>May the Silver Key guide our way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052450/extras/3b4065e3f2929c4c9ac45cf6fde5b3e8.avif?t=1739300850\" width=586 height=368 /></span>",
